==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
This stage is very similar to the 2nd chapter's version of this stage, as the [[Le'Solar]] is buffed to 200%, compared to the 250% of the second chapter's version of the stage. You can use anti-starred alien attackers, as the [[Zomboe]] can be dealt with using [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife/Polevaulter Cat]], allowing you to focus on killing the Le'Solar and the Corporal Weyland.

==='''Chapter 2'''===
-

==='''Chapter 3'''===
Le'Solar is a joke and can be easily killed with [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], being fully capable of bursting her down without any issue. The supporting peons shouldn't be a problem can be handled with designated counters like [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]] and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]]. Do be wary of the Zuches and Zollows specifically, they can occasionally make the cleanup phase very tedious if not properly dealt with.

